&lt;li&gt;Impact from day one: Resolving a production incident or supporting a Portfolio Manager has an immediate effect on PnL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and run: We don&#39;t just troubleshoot, we optimise. You&#39;ll have the autonomy to identify repetitive pain points and work with partner teams to automate and evolve our processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global perspective: Follow-the-sun coverage means close collaboration with support teams in the US and APAC, so you&#39;ll learn and share best practices globally.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
